# Move mode on the home grid (study 046 P2): a tile picked up and moved, at 640x480 (the deck, 3x2), 480x800 (PDA
# portrait on the profile pda with its writing zone: 3 columns, the band never on the home grid), 720x720 (3x3) and
# 1024x600 (4x2, computed). Review only: no golden; the order is checked with expect_tiles (the grid's tiles in the
# order drawn) and the restore with expect_same.
#   1. a hold let go after its bar showed (1.2 s on Calculator): no launch, no move
#   2. a 3 s hold on Calculator: the bar under the tile mid-fill, then the tile picked up (accent outline, move badge,
#      the caption in the status line with a keyboard present); the release launches nothing
#   3. Up, Left, Enter: moved one row and one slot, dropped, saved; a new app list (as after a restart) keeps it
#   4. Ctrl+O on the selected tile (Calculator), a swipe that scrolls the grid (640x480: move mode stays on), a tap on
#      Python: placed there and dropped
#   5. Ctrl+O, Right, Down, Esc: the grid exactly as before the pick-up
#   6. the config store full: Ctrl+O, Left, Enter: "Cannot save the order (settings full)", the stored order kept
#   7. no keyboard: the touch-only caption; a tap on the picked tile drops it in place; a slow swipe in normal mode
#      picks nothing up; the screen dimming while a tile is carried puts it back
#   8. a short tap still launches (Calculator's page)
# Touches go through the display manager's touch path (touchbutton / tapbutton: the tile holding the label); keys
# through the real queue (key CTRL+O: KEY_O with KBD_MOD_CTRL, what the trackpoint's held click sends).
title home move
review
sizes 640x480 480x800 720x720 1024x600
@480x800 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
keyboards 1
apps Settings Store CLI Python SSH Calculator Snake Tank
home
shot move_home
# 1. given up after the bar showed: nothing launches, nothing moves
touchbutton Calculator
wait 1200
release
shot move_hold_given_up
expect_tiles Settings Store CLI Python SSH Calculator Snake Tank
# 2. the 3 s hold: mid-fill (about 2 s when the shot is taken), then picked up
touchbutton Calculator
wait 1300
shot move_hold
wait 1200
release
shot move_picked
expect_text end "Enter drop  -  Esc cancel"
expect_tiles Settings Store CLI Python SSH Calculator Snake Tank
# 3. arrows (3 columns: 5 -> 2 -> 1; 4 columns: 5 -> 1 -> 0), Enter drops and saves
key UP
key LEFT
shot move_arrows
@640x480,480x800,720x720 expect_tiles Settings Calculator Store CLI Python SSH Snake Tank
@1024x600 expect_tiles Calculator Settings Store CLI Python SSH Snake Tank
key ENTER
shot move_dropped
@640x480,480x800,720x720 expect_tiles Settings Calculator Store CLI Python SSH Snake Tank
@1024x600 expect_tiles Calculator Settings Store CLI Python SSH Snake Tank
# the same tiles in today's order, as after a restart: the stored order applies
apps Settings Store CLI Python SSH Calculator Snake Tank
home
@640x480,480x800,720x720 expect_tiles Settings Calculator Store CLI Python SSH Snake Tank
@1024x600 expect_tiles Calculator Settings Store CLI Python SSH Snake Tank
# 4. Ctrl+O picks the selected tile; the grid still scrolls (640x480: one row up); a tap on Python places and drops
key CTRL+O
@640x480 drag 320 400 320 280 30
@640x480 shot move_scrolled
@640x480 expect_text end "Enter drop  -  Esc cancel"
tapbutton Python
shot move_tap_placed
expect_tiles Settings Store CLI Python Calculator SSH Snake Tank
# 5. Esc puts it back exactly
shot move_before_pick
key CTRL+O
key RIGHT
key DOWN
shot move_before_esc
key ESC
shot move_esc
expect_tiles Settings Store CLI Python Calculator SSH Snake Tank
expect_same move_before_pick
# 6. the store is full: the move is not kept
configfull on
key CTRL+O
key LEFT
key ENTER
shot move_cannot_save
expect_tiles Settings Store CLI Python Calculator SSH Snake Tank
configfull off
# 7. no keyboard: the touch-only caption; a tap on the picked tile drops it where it is
keyboards 0
touchbutton Calculator
wait 3200
release
shot move_picked_touch
expect_text "Tap a spot to place the app"
tapbutton Calculator
shot move_touch_dropped
expect_tiles Settings Store CLI Python Calculator SSH Snake Tank
# 7b. a slow swipe in normal mode (640x480, 1.4 s from a tile): the grid scrolls, no bar, nothing picked up, and the
# tap of step 8 is not swallowed
@640x480 drag 112 150 112 300 40
@640x480 shot move_swipe_normal
# 7c. the screen dims while a tile is carried (DarkTime 10 s): the tile goes back; the touch that wakes the screen is
# the screensaver's (swallowed; the harness's keys do not pass the saver's key filter)
keyboards 1
config dark_time 10
screensaver
key CTRL+O
key RIGHT
wait 10600
shot move_dimmed
tap 10 10
shot move_after_dim
expect_tiles Settings Store CLI Python Calculator SSH Snake Tank
# 8. a short tap launches, as before
tapbutton Calculator
shot move_tap_launches
